 "<cr>On the 22nd of June 1941, the invasion of the Soviet Union began, opening up the Eastern Front and committing Germany to a two front war. The Axis Powers offensive, invading along a 2,900-kilometer front that stretched from the Arctic Ocean in the North to the Black Sea in the South, saw the greatest invasion force ever known to mankind: around 3.8 million men, supported by around 600,000 vehicles and 600,000 horses.<cr>At the start of the invasion, 80% of the available Soviet military forces in the West had been deployed on the border that faced Axis territories as the first strategic echelon. The deployment of the remaining 20% was along the Dvina and Dnieper Rivers as the second echelon and was meant to serve as a spearhead to the Soviet counteroffensive in case of a German invasion.<cr>At the time of the invasion, the Red Army was in the process of reorganisation and modernisation. Its capabilities were greatly reduced from the Purges of the 1930s, strongly affecting the quality of the officer corps. Moreover the standing and morale of the Red Army had been shaken as a result of the Winter War with Finland. On the other hand, after the successful campaigns that had brought Europe to its knees, the German Wehrmacht had consolidated itself as an experienced army, with good training, organisation, and an excellent officer corps.<cr> The titanic struggle between the two major powers and their conflicting ideologies has just begun and it will only end when one of them has been completely destroyed.": "<cr>1941年6月22日，苏联入侵行动开始，东线就此开辟，德国由此陷入两线作战。轴心国攻势沿2900公里战线推进，北起北冰洋、南至黑海，投入人类历史上规模最大的入侵兵力：约380万人，另有约60万辆车辆和60万匹战马支援。<cr>入侵开始时，苏军西部可用兵力的80%作为第一战略梯队，部署在面向轴心国领土的边境。其余20%沿德维纳河和第聂伯河部署为第二梯队，原计划在德军入侵时充当苏军反攻的矛头。<cr>入侵之时，红军正处于改编和现代化进程中。1930年代的大清洗大幅削弱了其战力，军官队伍素质受到严重影响。此外，与芬兰的冬季战争动摇了红军的声望和士气。另一方面，在令欧洲屈服的历次成功战役之后，德国国防军已锤炼为一支经验丰富的军队，训练有素、组织严密、军官队伍优秀。<cr>两大强国及其对立意识形态之间的殊死搏斗刚刚开始，只有其中一方被彻底摧毁才会结束。",
 "After Soviet forces cross the Bulgarian-Rumanian border, the pro Axis government is overthrown by army units together with Fatherland Front detachments after capturing key locations in Sophia such as various ministries, the post, the telegraph, the radio and the railway station. War is declared on Germany and its allies and an armistice is signed with Allies in Moscow. Three Bulgarian armies (numbering 340,000 men) begin mobilizing and preparing to move into Yugoslavia and Macedonia with the task of blocking German forces retreating from Greece. <cr><cr>- Bulgaria Surrenders<cr>- Soviet Union takes control of Bulgaria and Thrace regionsQ": "苏军越过保加利亚—罗马尼亚边境后，亲轴心国政府在军队与祖国阵线支队占领索非亚各部、邮政、电报局、广播电台和火车站等关键地点后被推翻。保加利亚对德国及其盟国宣战，并在莫斯科与盟国签署停战协定。保加利亚三个集团军（共34万人）开始动员，准备进入南斯拉夫和马其顿，任务是阻断从希腊撤退的德军。<cr><cr>- 保加利亚投降<cr>- 苏联取得保加利亚与色雷斯地区控制权",
 "Allies capture Le Havre. Operation Astonia was the codename for the Allied attack on the German-held Channel port of Le Havre. The city had been declared a Festung (fortress) by Hitler. The Allied objective was to secure the harbour facilities intact, to deliver supplies to the Allied armies in Continental Europe. The land attack was carried out by British and Canadian troops, and the German garrison of about 11,000 men surrendered. The port was badly damaged but it was re-opened four weeks later. <cr><cr>- Upper Normandy region captured by Allies&": "盟军夺取勒阿弗尔。「阿斯托尼亚」行动是盟军攻击德军控制的英吉利海峡港口勒阿弗尔的代号。希特勒曾宣布该城为「要塞」。盟军的目标是完整夺取港口设施，以便向欧洲大陆的盟军部队输送补给。地面进攻由英军和加军实施，约11000人的德军守备部队投降。港口损毁严重，但四周后重新开放。<cr><cr>- 上诺曼底地区由盟军占领",
 "Allies capture Picardy, Champagne, Lorraine, Alsace and Luxembourg regions. Patton's Third Army captures Reims and Chalons, then Verdun, St.-Mihiel, and Commercy two days later. One week later it establishes a bridgehead over the Moselle River south of Metz. The US First Army takes the capital city of Luxembourg three days later.<cr><cr>- WA capture Picardy, Champagne, Lorraine, Alsace and Luxembourg regions'": "盟军夺取皮卡第、香槟、洛林、阿尔萨斯和卢森堡地区。巴顿的第3集团军攻占兰斯和沙隆，两天后又夺取凡尔登、圣米耶勒和科梅尔西。一周后在梅斯以南的摩泽尔河上建立桥头堡。三天后，美军第1集团军攻占卢森堡首都。<cr><cr>- 西方盟军夺取皮卡第、香槟、洛林、阿尔萨斯和卢森堡地区",
 "As Soviet forces enter Rumania, King Michael I of Rumania leads a coup that pulls Rumania out of the Axis and into a position as an ally of the Soviet Union. Many Rumanian forces switch sides and begin fighting for the Soviets.<cr><cr>- Rumania surrenders<cr>- Game Event Bulgaria Surrenders to SU set to Active and event Date set to 14 days from the current date<cr>- Game Event SU Offensive on Belgrade set to Active and event Date set to 28 days from the current date<cr>- Units of the newly reconstituted pro-Soviet 1st and 4th Rumanian Armies have their delays set to 1<cr>- Balkans Air Requirement decreases to 0^": "苏军进入罗马尼亚后，国王米哈伊一世发动政变，使罗马尼亚脱离轴心国，转而成为苏联的盟国。大批罗马尼亚部队倒戈，开始为苏联作战。<cr><cr>- 罗马尼亚投降<cr>- 事件「保加利亚向苏联投降」设为激活，日期设为当前日期后 14 天<cr>- 事件「苏联进攻贝尔格莱德」设为激活，日期设为当前日期后 28 天<cr>- 新编成的亲苏罗马尼亚第1、第4集团军各部队的延迟设为 1<cr>- 巴尔干航空需求降为 0",
 "Axis forces in North Africa surrender to the Allies. A few units are evacuated to the Axis Reserve, but most surrender. The North African Campaign ends. <cr><cr>-A few Axis ground units in North Africa evacuate to the Reserve, most surrender.<cr>- Most Axis air units in North Africa evacuate to the Reserve, a few are overrun.<cr>- North Africa Theater Box is now inactive<cr>- Italy TB air combat intensity increased to LOW (2)<cr>- Game Event What's Next? set to Active<cr>- Game Event Italian Campaign Advances set to Active<cr>- Game Event Italian Campaign Delayed set to Activee": "北非轴心国部队向盟军投降。少数部队撤入轴心国预备队，大部分投降。北非战役结束。<cr><cr>- 北非少数轴心国地面部队撤入预备队，大部分投降<cr>- 北非大部分轴心国航空部队撤入预备队，少数被击溃<cr>- 北非战区箱进入非活动状态<cr>- 意大利战区空战强度提升为低（2）<cr>- 事件「接下来怎么办？」设为激活<cr>- 事件「意大利战役推进」设为激活<cr>- 事件「意大利战役延宕」设为激活",
 "Belgrade liberated from the Germans by a joint effort of the Soviet Red Army, Yugoslav Partisans and the Bulgarian Peoples Army. Although most of the liberated territory is returned to Yugoslavian control, Soviet forces are able to utilize the rail lines to help supply the fighting in Hungary. <cr><cr>- Balkans TB ground combat intensity reduced to VERY LOW (1) <cr>- Balkans TB air combat intensity reduced to VERY LOW (1) <cr>- Serbia region controlled by Soviets.<cr>- Game Event Macedonia under SU Control set to Active and event Date set to 30 days from the current date<cr>- Game Event Albania under SU Control set to Active and event Date set to 37 days from the current date<cr>- Game Event Montenegro Liberated set to Active and event Date set to 52 days from the current date<cr>- Game Event Bosnia & Herzegovina Liberated set to Active and event Date set to 185 days from the current datey": "贝尔格莱德由苏联红军、南斯拉夫游击队和保加利亚人民军共同从德军手中解放。虽然大部分解放区交还南斯拉夫管理，但苏军得以利用铁路为匈牙利的作战提供补给。<cr><cr>- 巴尔干战区地面战斗强度降为极低（1）<cr>- 巴尔干战区空战强度降为极低（1）<cr>- 塞尔维亚地区由苏军控制<cr>- 事件「马其顿归苏联控制」设为激活，日期设为当前日期后 30 天<cr>- 事件「阿尔巴尼亚归苏联控制」设为激活，日期设为当前日期后 37 天<cr>- 事件「黑山解放」设为激活，日期设为当前日期后 52 天<cr>- 事件「波黑解放」设为激活，日期设为当前日期后 185 天",
 "By early spring of 1942, larger size raids (1,000 bombers per raid) start being conducted over Germany and other Axis territory. During this year, bombing strategies and tactics start evolving, including changes such as the Area Bombing Directive, the Bomber Stream and the Master Bomber tactic. An increasing amount of new bombing systems, ordinance and aircraft are incorporated into the bombing campaign. Among those are the Gee radio navigation system, the 8,000 lb Blockbuster bomb and B-17 aircraft. <cr><cr>- Target: Manpower <cr>- Damage 40, Radius 50, Raids 1": "到1942年初春，对德国及其他轴心国领土的空袭规模开始扩大（每次约1000架轰炸机）。这一年里，轰炸战略与战术不断演进，出现了「区域轰炸指令」、轰炸机流和主轰炸机引导战术等变化。越来越多的新型轰炸系统、弹药和机型投入轰炸战役，其中包括「Gee」无线电导航系统、8000磅级「大满贯」炸弹和B-17轰炸机。<cr><cr>- 目标：人力<cr>- 损伤 40，半径 50，空袭 1 次",
 "During the 2nd half of 1943 the US 8th AF continues its massive 1,000 bomber raids on German industries. Most significant are the August to December raids on the German aircraft industry. 5,092 tons of explosives are dropped on 14 targeted aircraft plants (mostly airframe plants). Prodution of single-engine fighters (ME 109s and FW 190s) drops by 45%.<cr>The Americans take heavy losses in their raid in August against Regensburg and Schweinfurt, losing 60 planes and 664 crewmen KIA or POW. A later attack of the ball bearing plants around Schweinfurt in October also causes heavy losses, with the Americans losing 60 aircraft with 600 crewmen KIA or POW. These losses amount to 25% of the attacking force. <cr><cr>- Target: Heavy Industry <cr>- Damage 100, Radius 55, Raids 1 <cr><cr>- Target: Airframe <cr>- Damage 100, Radius 50, Raids 1 <cr><cr>- Target: Railyard <cr>- Damage 100, Radius 50, Raids 1": "1943年下半年，美国第8航空队继续以千机规模空袭德国工业。其中最重要的是8月至12月对德国航空工业的打击：5092吨炸药投向14家航空工厂（多为机体厂），单发战斗机（Bf 109与Fw 190）产量下降45%。<cr>8月对雷根斯堡和施韦因富特的空袭中，美军损失惨重，60架飞机、664名机组人员阵亡或被俘。10月对施韦因富特周边轴承厂的再次空袭同样损失巨大，60架飞机、600名机组人员阵亡或被俘，占出击兵力的25%。<cr><cr>- 目标：重工业<cr>- 损伤 100，半径 55，空袭 1 次<cr><cr>- 目标：机体工业<cr>- 损伤 100，半径 50，空袭 1 次<cr><cr>- 目标：铁路调车场<cr>- 损伤 100，半径 50，空袭 1 次",
 "From airfields in Libya, The American 9th AF conducts bombing raids on the Ploesti oil fields and refineries in Rumania as part of Operation Tidal Wave with the goal of denying petroleum-based fuel to the Axis powers. The Americans lose 53 aircraft and 660 air crewmen in the operation, one of the costliest major Allied air raids of the war. The mission fails to curtail fuel production output. <cr><cr>- Target: Oil <cr>- Damage 50, Radius 115, Raids 1 <cr><cr>- Target: Fuel <cr>- Damage 50, Radius 115, Raids 1 <cr><cr>- Target: Railyard <cr>- Damage 50, Radius 115, Raids 1": "美国第9航空队从利比亚机场出发，执行「浪潮」行动，空袭罗马尼亚的普洛耶什蒂油田与炼油厂，目的是切断轴心国的石油燃料供应。美军在此次行动中损失53架飞机和660名空勤人员，是盟军战时代价最惨重的大规模空袭之一。此次任务未能削减燃料产量。<cr><cr>- 目标：石油<cr>- 损伤 50，半径 115，空袭 1 次<cr><cr>- 目标：燃料<cr>- 损伤 50，半径 115，空袭 1 次<cr><cr>- 目标：铁路调车场<cr>- 损伤 50，半径 115，空袭 1 次",
 "Having broken the German line in Normandy, the Allies form the Falaise pocket and then race across France. The Allies take the Channel ports, central and eastern France. Allies invade southern France. <cr><cr>- Roughly 20% of German ground forces in the Western Europe TB surrender<cr>- Western Europe TB ground combat intensity decreased to HIGH (4)<cr>- Western Europe Ground Requirement decreases to 550<cr>- Norway Ground Requirement decreases to 75<cr>- Balkans Ground Requirement decreases to 130": "盟军突破诺曼底德军防线后，形成法莱斯包围圈，随后横扫法国。盟军夺取海峡各港口以及法国中部和东部，并在法国南部登陆。<cr><cr>- 西欧战区约20%的德国地面部队投降<cr>- 西欧战区地面战斗强度降为高（4）<cr>- 西欧地面需求降为 550<cr>- 挪威地面需求降为 75<cr>- 巴尔干地面需求降为 130",
 "Having crossed the Rhine north and south of the industrial Ruhr area, the US 1st and 9th armies pocket large German forces and force them to surrender. <cr><cr>- The Rheinland region is captured by the Allies<cr>- Roughly 30% of ground forces in the Western Europe TB surrender<cr>- Western Europe Ground Requirement decreases to 345<cr>- Norway Ground Requirement decreases to 68<cr>- Balkans Ground Requirement decreases to 100=": "美军第1和第9集团军在鲁尔工业区南北两侧渡过莱茵河，包围德军重兵并迫其投降。<cr><cr>- 莱茵兰地区由盟军占领<cr>- 西欧战区约30%的地面部队投降<cr>- 西欧地面需求降为 345<cr>- 挪威地面需求降为 68<cr>- 巴尔干地面需求降为 100",
 "Having lost Sicily and facing invasion of the mainland, the Italian Government surrenders and switches sides. The Germans in Italy are prepared for this and implement Operation Achse to disarm Italian units and occupy important defensive positions. German forces also move swiftly to take over the Italian zones of occupation in the Balkans and southern France. <cr><cr>- Italy Surrenders<cr>- Game Event Campaign for France Advances set to Active<cr>- Game Event Campaign for France Delayed set to Active<cr>- Game Event The Shrinking Axis set to Active": "在失去西西里、面临本土登陆之际，意大利政府投降并倒向盟国。驻意德军早有准备，随即实施「轴心」行动，解除意军武装并占领各重要防御阵地。德军还迅速接管意大利在巴尔干和法国南部的占领区。<cr><cr>- 意大利投降<cr>- 事件「法国战役推进」设为激活<cr>- 事件「法国战役延宕」设为激活<cr>- 事件「轴心国收缩」设为激活",
 "Having lost hundreds of thousands of men in the Normandy fighting, and facing Allied armies sweeping across France, Germany orders full mobilization of its available manpower. Many Luftwaffe and naval personnel are quickly transferred to the ground forces, while additional men are called up for military duty. This manpower is insufficiently trained in ground combat operations.<cr><cr>- 200,000 men are added to the German manpower pool<cr>- The German manpower multiplier is increased by 4<cr>- German Ground National Morale is reduced by 5{": "在诺曼底损失数十万人、且盟军横扫法国之际，德国下令全面动员可用人力。大批空军和海军人员被迅速转入地面部队，另有更多男子被征召入伍。这些人力在地面作战方面训练不足。<cr><cr>- 德国人力池增加 20 万人<cr>- 德国人力系数提高 4<cr>- 德国陆军国民士气下降 5",
 "Having pushed the Germans back from Leningrad, and after moving strong forces opposite Finland, the Soviet army launches a major offensive to drive Finland from the war. <cr><cr>- Finland TB ground combat set to high (4) <cr>- Northern Front ground combat set to very high (5)<cr>- Game Event Finland Holds Strong set to Active<cr>- Game Event Finland Wavers set to Active<cr>- Game Event Northern Front Held Up set to Active<cr>- Game Event Northern Front Pushes West set to Active<cr>- Date set for Game Event SU Retakes Occupied Areas to 81 days from now<cr>- Date set for Game Event Finland Surredners to 102 days from now<cr>- Game Event It's Only a Matter of Time is set to Active (if not already active)": "苏军在将德军自列宁格勒击退、并在芬兰当面集结重兵之后，发动大规模攻势，力图迫使芬兰退出战争。<cr><cr>- 芬兰战区地面战斗强度设为高（4）<cr>- 北方面军地面战斗强度设为极高（5）<cr>- 事件「芬兰坚守」设为激活<cr>- 事件「芬兰动摇」设为激活<cr>- 事件「北方面军受阻」设为激活<cr>- 事件「北方面军西进」设为激活<cr>- 事件「苏联收复被占领土」日期设为 81 天后<cr>- 事件「芬兰投降」日期设为 102 天后<cr>- 事件「只是时间问题」设为激活（若尚未激活）",
 "Karelian Army advances through Karelian Isthmus, halts offensive, and takes up defensive positions. <cr><cr>- Karelian Isthmus region is captured by the Axis [Finnish TB (AX)]<cr>- Finnish TB (AX) ground combat intensity is set to VERY LOW(1)<cr>- Northern Front TB (SO) ground combat intensity is set to LOW(2)<cr>- Game Event Shortage of Forces in NF set to Active<cr>- Game Event Excess Forces in NF set to Active<cr>- Game Event Shortage of Forces in Finland set to Active<cr>- Game Event Excess Forces in Finland set to Active": "卡累利阿集团军穿过卡累利阿地峡推进，随后停止攻势、转入防御阵地。<cr><cr>- 卡累利阿地峡地区由轴心国占领〔芬兰战区（轴心）〕<cr>- 芬兰战区（轴心）地面战斗强度设为极低（1）<cr>- 北方面军战区（苏联）地面战斗强度设为低（2）<cr>- 事件「北方面军兵力不足」设为激活<cr>- 事件「北方面军兵力过剩」设为激活<cr>- 事件「芬兰兵力不足」设为激活<cr>- 事件「芬兰兵力过剩」设为激活",
 "Situation Report": "战况报告",
 "The Allies capture the Abruzzo region. In the most mountainous areas of Abruzzo, more than half the width of the peninsula comprises crests and peaks over 3,000 feet (910 m) that were relatively easy for the Germans to defend. The spurs and re-entrants to the spine confronted the Allies with a succession of ridges and rivers across their line of advance. The rivers were subject to sudden and unexpected flooding, which constantly thwarted the Allied commanders' plans. <cr><cr>- Abruzzo region captured by the Allies": "盟军夺取阿布鲁佐地区。在阿布鲁佐山地最多之处，半岛宽度的一半以上是海拔3000英尺（910米）以上的山脊与峰顶，德军防守相对容易。主山脊伸出的支脉与凹谷，让盟军在进攻正面上遭遇一连串山岭与河流。这些河流常常突然暴涨，一再打乱盟军指挥官的部署。<cr><cr>- 阿布鲁佐地区由盟军占领",
 "The Allies capture the Calabria region in southern Italy. The British Eighth Army's XIII Corps, composed of the 1st Canadian and the British 5th Infantry Divisions, launches Operation Baytown, involving amphibious landings across the Strait of Messina to Reggio di Calabria, the largest city in the Calabria region. Opposition to the landings is light and the Italian units surrender almost with no resistence. <cr><cr>- Calabria region captured by the Allies": "盟军夺取意大利南部的卡拉布里亚地区。英国第8集团军第13军（辖加拿大第1师和英国第5步兵师）发起「贝敦」行动，渡过墨西拿海峡、在卡拉布里亚最大城市雷焦卡拉布里亚登陆。登陆抵抗轻微，意军几乎未作抵抗便投降。<cr><cr>- 卡拉布里亚地区由盟军占领",
 "The Allies capture the island of Corsica after a landing by the French I Corps. German forces in the island successfully evacuate to mainland Italy via the port to Bastia, leaving behind 700 dead and 350 POWs.<cr>During his visit to Corsica, General de Gaulle praises the effort and sacrifices the Corsican people have made. For the islands inhabitants, the Liberation does not mean peace, but rather a return to war alongside the Allies. 12,000 Corsicans between the ages of 20 and 28 are mobilized. Furthermore, the region starts being used as a naval and air base to control maritime connections and as a base for attacks against Central and Northern Italy, which are still held by the Germans. <cr><cr>- Corsica region captured by the Allies": "法国第1军登陆后，盟军夺取科西嘉岛。岛上德军经巴斯蒂亚港成功撤往意大利本土，留下700具尸体和350名战俘。<cr>戴高乐将军在视察科西嘉时赞扬了科西嘉人民的付出与牺牲。对岛上居民而言，解放并不意味着和平，而是重返战场、与盟军并肩作战。12000名20至28岁的科西嘉人被征召。此外，该地区开始被用作海空军基地，以控制海上交通，并作为进攻仍由德军控制的中意大利与北意大利的跳板。<cr><cr>- 科西嘉地区由盟军占领",
 "The Allies capture the regions of Puglia, Basilicata and Campania. The final phases of Operation Avalanche (the allied landings near Salerno) involves the capture of the important port of Naples and the capture of the airfield complex at Foggia. The Germans are forced to retreat to their defensive line along the Volturno and Trigno Rivers. <cr><cr>- Puglia region captured by the Allies <cr>- Basilicata region captured by the Allies <cr>- Campania region captured by the Allies": "盟军夺取普利亚、巴西利卡塔和坎帕尼亚三个地区。「雪崩」行动（盟军在萨莱诺附近登陆）的最后阶段包括夺取重要港口那不勒斯和福贾机场群。德军被迫退守沃尔图诺河与特里尼奥河一线。<cr><cr>- 普利亚地区由盟军占领<cr>- 巴西利卡塔地区由盟军占领<cr>- 坎帕尼亚地区由盟军占领",
 "The Allies land on the Italian mainland in three separate locations: The main invasion force lands around Salerno as part of Operation Avalanche, while two supporting operations take place further south in Calabria (Operation Baytown) and in Taranto (Operation Slapstick). The Germans react and begin mobilizing forces in southern Italy as well as launching the invasion of Northern Italy all the way down to Rome. <cr><cr>- Italy TB ground combat intensity increases to MEDIUM (3)j": "盟军在意大利本土三处登陆：主力在萨莱诺附近登陆（「雪崩」行动），另有两场辅助行动在更南方的卡拉布里亚（「贝敦」行动）和塔兰托（「闹剧」行动）展开。德军随即反应，开始在南意大利调动兵力，同时发动对北意大利的进攻，一路推进至罗马。<cr><cr>- 意大利战区地面战斗强度提升为中（3）",
 "The US 8th Air Force conducts multiple large bomber raids against Axis railyards and heavy industry areas. These raids involve around 300 to 400 bombers. The most significant of them is the 5 month long bombing campaign of the German Ruhr industry complex. The effect of this campaign is a servere reduction in the production output of steel and armaments. <cr><cr>- Target: Railyard <cr>- Damage 100, Radius 40, Raids 1 <cr><cr>- Target: Heavy Industry <cr>- Damage 50, Radius 40, Raids 1": "美国第8航空队多次以大规模机群空袭轴心国的铁路调车场和重工业区，每次投入约300至400架轰炸机。其中最重要的是对德国鲁尔工业区长达5个月的轰炸。这场战役使钢铁与军工产量大幅下降。<cr><cr>- 目标：铁路调车场<cr>- 损伤 100，半径 40，空袭 1 次<cr><cr>- 目标：重工业<cr>- 损伤 50，半径 40，空袭 1 次",
 "With the Germans pushed back from Leningrad, there is an opportunity for the Soviets to attack Finland and knock it out of the war. A Soviet offensive will be launched that promises to remove Finland from the Axis if the following conditions are met:<cr>(1) Kingisepp, Luga, and Novgorod are Soviet controlled<cr>(2) The Soviets have forces amounting to at least 110% of their Ground Requirement in the Northern Front Theater Box<cr><cr>- Game Event Soviet Northern Offensive is set to Active": "德军被逐离列宁格勒后，苏联获得了进攻芬兰、迫其退出战争的机会。若满足以下条件，苏军将发动攻势，有望使芬兰脱离轴心国：<cr>（1）金吉谢普、卢加和诺夫哥罗德由苏联控制<cr>（2）苏联在北方面军战区箱内的兵力不低于其地面需求的110%<cr><cr>- 事件「苏联北方攻势」设为激活"
}